  "date": "2026-11-12",
  "status": "not checked by a person",
  "method": "Tag groups proposed after a look at the numbers of all 34 runs (order, end position, lift, path and contact pairs of each block). The end layout is the same in all runs (the task gives the target of each block), so it is not a tag group. Film strips of 2 runs were made, but the blocks are too small in the pictures to check the tags. No program text was read.",
  "rules": "experiments/contacts/tag_rules/balancebeam3d.py"
 },
 "insights": [
  "28 of 34 runs put the large block on the beam first. It goes to the centre, so the beam stays level. 6 runs start with a small block.",
  "The end layout is the same in all runs, because the task gives the target of each block. The differences are in the order and in the style of the motion.",
  "The carry height depends on the method: all opus55 and opus55-source runs carry low, and all astra-source runs carry high.",
  "The contact view finds 3 strategies, and it separates the order fully (1.00)."
 ],
